1
00:00:00,823 --> 00:00:03,063
Ever sent an AI reply…

2
00:00:04,119 --> 00:00:06,239
and your friend instantly knew?

3
00:00:06,919 --> 00:00:08,949
Yeah. Me too.

4
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,820
So I built SaySo.

5
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,530
SaySo is an app that

6
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:13,960
learns how you write, from

7
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:16,110
your own chats and emails.

8
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,457
Four tabs: Chat. Styles. Keyboard.

9
00:00:20,547 --> 00:00:21,837
And Settings.

10
00:00:22,122 --> 00:00:23,022
It has its own

11
00:00:23,022 --> 00:00:24,372
keyboard, and a shortcut

12
00:00:24,372 --> 00:00:26,162
for the Action Button.

13
00:00:27,121 --> 00:00:28,261
A keyboard that

14
00:00:28,261 --> 00:00:29,541
texts like me.

15
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:31,927
I type what I mean,

16
00:00:33,622 --> 00:00:34,902
tap the sparkle,

17
00:00:38,716 --> 00:00:39,716
and my own model

18
00:00:39,716 --> 00:00:40,716
writes it the way

19
00:00:40,716 --> 00:00:42,346
I'd actually say it.

20
00:00:42,518 --> 00:00:45,563
Even in bursts. Tap, send,

21
00:00:45,593 --> 00:00:46,423
next.

22
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,470
No keyboard?

23
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,910
Press the Action Button.

24
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,600
Who's it for,

25
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:55,050
what should I say.

26
00:00:59,620 --> 00:01:01,800
Three replies in my voice.

27
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:04,740
Pick one, paste, done.

28
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,100
Same vibe in the app.

29
00:01:08,197 --> 00:01:09,767
Ask for a story,

30
00:01:14,622 --> 00:01:16,472
get it as real messages.

31
00:01:19,220 --> 00:01:20,030
Where does my

32
00:01:20,030 --> 00:01:21,270
voice come from?

33
00:01:21,423 --> 00:01:23,303
My own chats and emails.

34
00:01:24,024 --> 00:01:25,834
This is the Styles tab.

35
00:01:25,834 --> 00:01:29,174
Ninety-three percent: on messages it

36
00:01:29,174 --> 00:01:31,294
never saw, SaySo gets that

37
00:01:31,294 --> 00:01:33,414
close to me. Generic AI,

38
00:01:33,414 --> 00:01:34,754
sixty-nine.

39
00:01:34,838 --> 00:01:36,398
Below, how I write to

40
00:01:36,398 --> 00:01:38,128
each kind of person.

41
00:01:38,215 --> 00:01:40,415
Emails get their own style:

42
00:01:40,415 --> 00:01:43,045
greeting, sign-off, tone and length.

43
00:01:43,143 --> 00:01:44,533
It learns how I write,

44
00:01:44,533 --> 00:01:44,933
never what others said.

45
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,110
Essays too.

46
00:01:47,318 --> 00:01:48,598
I just talk,

47
00:01:49,917 --> 00:01:50,757
it writes in

48
00:01:50,757 --> 00:01:52,027
my formal voice,

49
00:01:52,267 --> 00:01:54,047
only from my facts.

50
00:01:54,132 --> 00:01:55,102
Then it asks how

51
00:01:55,102 --> 00:01:56,732
to make it stronger.

52
00:01:57,820 --> 00:02:00,277
Too casual? Thumbs down.

53
00:02:05,024 --> 00:02:06,154
It fixes it,

54
00:02:07,818 --> 00:02:09,188
and remembers.

55
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,680
Under the hood:

56
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,550
four Meta models.

57
00:02:12,943 --> 00:02:15,263
Muse Spark Open writes my

58
00:02:15,263 --> 00:02:17,913
messages and emails. Muse Spark

59
00:02:17,913 --> 00:02:20,223
1.3 reads screenshots and writes

60
00:02:20,223 --> 00:02:22,543
essays. Muse Voice Transcribe turns

61
00:02:22,543 --> 00:02:24,633
my voice into text.

62
00:02:25,019 --> 00:02:26,609
And Muse Glimmer carries my

63
00:02:26,609 --> 00:02:28,199
own LoRA, trained on my

64
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:30,229
messages, for the keyboard.

65
00:02:30,618 --> 00:02:32,248
The real test: I mixed

66
00:02:32,248 --> 00:02:34,428
my real messages with SaySo's,

67
00:02:34,428 --> 00:02:35,788
and my friends had to

68
00:02:35,788 --> 00:02:37,308
guess which were mine.

69
00:02:37,694 --> 00:02:39,374
They got it right fifty-three

70
00:02:39,374 --> 00:02:41,284
percent of the time. Barely

71
00:02:41,284 --> 00:02:42,724
better than a coin flip.

72
00:02:42,724 --> 00:02:44,164
Small sample, but that's the

73
00:02:44,164 --> 00:02:45,064
idea.

74
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,530
Your words.

75
00:02:48,220 --> 00:02:49,490
Your voice.

76
00:02:49,585 --> 00:02:51,565
You always press send.

77
00:02:54,016 --> 00:02:55,826
This is SaySo.

